# Old Documentation Archive

This folder contains documentation from the previous build.
These files are kept for reference but should NOT be used for the new Clean Architecture implementation.

## DO NOT USE THESE FILES FOR:
- Context about current architecture
- Implementation guidance
- API references
- Component structure

## Refer to the new documentation in:
- `/docs/memory-bank/` - New memory bank files
- `/docs/clean-architecture/` - Clean Architecture documentation
- Root level architecture files (EMU_BEST_PRACTICES_ARCHITECTURE.md, etc.)
